{
  "name": "Generate AI captions and post to Instagram and Pinterest",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Generate AI captions and post to Instagram and Pinterest\n\n### Who's it for\n\nCreators and marketers who want AI written posts published automatically.\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Runs when you click Execute Workflow.\n2. Sets the topic, text, or other inputs used to build the post.\n3. Generates platform-optimized post text with the OpenAI model.\n4. Publishes a post to Instagram via the SocialRobot API. Publishes a post to Pinterest via the SocialRobot API.\n\n### How to set up\n\n- [ ] Install the SocialRobot community node, then create an API key at [socialrobot.io](https://socialrobot.io) (Scheduler -> API Keys) and connect your SocialRobot API credential.\n- [ ] Edit the fields in the Set node to set your topic or text.\n- [ ] Connect your OpenAI account in the OpenAI Chat Model node.\n- [ ] Select your connected account in each Publish node.\n- [ ] Set the Pinterest board ID in the Pinterest Publish node.\n\n### Requirements\n\n- A [SocialRobot](https://socialrobot.io) account with connected social channels and an API key.\n- An [OpenAI API key](https://platform.openai.com/api-keys), connected in the OpenAI Chat Model node.\n- A public image or video URL for Instagram.\n- A Pinterest board ID.\n",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 1004
      },
      "id": "7ee65732-6594-43e2-81b8-8e34fe8af94a",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
